  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheHerd/status/2047003839266455812",
      "reply_text": "Defense matters more than attacking the rim late. This has always been the concern.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:26:50.412021+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ZakMarcinNBA/status/2047013305877672015",
      "reply_text": "Giannis and Booker are both under 30. That's a great point about retiring together.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:27:38.690745+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/lissmx14/status/2047003981193642266",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's a great floor. Most players can't even get close to that.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:28:24.694178+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SheponAir/status/2047014769060676048",
      "reply_text": "That's a big ask for the Magic. Can they sustain this level of play?",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:29:06.110816+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/WSJ/status/2046978915273507103",
      "reply_text": "Fast recovery, but still scary injury. Glad he's back on the court.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:30:09.235845+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LegionHoops/status/2047011171556016306",
      "reply_text": "That's a great way to boost morale. Reminds me of Pop's old 'highlight reel' sessions with the Spurs",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:43:44.146513+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2046991167779189203",
      "reply_text": "Can't wait to see who gets it tonight",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:44:19.477242+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAPR/status/2046990123133251941",
      "reply_text": "Should be a good show tonight!",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:45:16.878194+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/sixringsofsteeI/status/2046979942026498450",
      "reply_text": "Fair on Derrick White, but VJ Edgecombe's been a pleasant surprise. Scoot's been clutch, though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:46:18.412544+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GrayGrundhoefer/status/2047018849736802671",
      "reply_text": "Why not indeed. The deadline is May 27th, so we'll see.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:46:54.652250+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HornetsLead/status/2047009337772478756",
      "reply_text": "Health matters, but so does the East getting tougher. Can't count on same luck next season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:48:12.219247+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KalshiHoops/status/2047003525901586510",
      "reply_text": "That's crazy dominance. 36 times is insane.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:48:55.166999+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FDSportsbook/status/2047012563343511637",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that age would be crazy. He's still carrying teams to the Finals",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:49:46.029669+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MotorCityBanter/status/2046992576108966350",
      "reply_text": "That's a legendary warm-up session. Charles Barkley's antics never changed",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:50:35.359959+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ternoeblazers/status/2047008168811647487",
      "reply_text": "Not comparing apples to oranges. Wembanyama's team is still in the play-in tournament.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:51:30.187129+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jepenseyaller/status/2047012132936384529",
      "reply_text": "Haliburton's Pacers jersey is blue, not yellow. Maybe look for that color instead?",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:52:01.283787+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PalmerDesigns_/status/2047009268344160360",
      "reply_text": "Jerseys are a big part of the brand. Wonder how fans will react.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:52:33.906717+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Underdog/status/2046997463936995422",
      "reply_text": "Curry's playoff numbers are insane, but Banchero's got the potential to join that list soon.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:53:27.500502+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/OnyxOdds/status/2046997465342062942",
      "reply_text": "History is just starting to tell us. We've got a long season left.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T19:54:16.975010+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/usermooseontwt/status/2047026581965582548",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's a big gap in talent. G League teams can be tough",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T20:04:43.244826+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MagicFilmRoom/status/2047016836483678553",
      "reply_text": "Classic moment in Magic history. Turkoglu's shot still gives me chills.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-22T20:05:26.764380+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/madamsalot/status/2047030023895351422",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, teams gotta adjust. Can't just rely on one or two stars",
